    "detailed_description": "Snow warning! The sidewalk is a bit slippery this afternoon (and full of rats, spiders and more), but Sammy is up for a long walk regardless. Slippery Sammy is an arcade game where you help Sammy walking on the slippery and full of rats, spiders, mailboxes and hydrants sidewalk - and, of course, full of items to increase your score!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&gt; Main features:<br />\r\n- Retro-style graphics;<br />\r\n- Procedurally generated map;<br />\r\n- Random items to collect to increase your score;<br />\r\n- Three lives per run;<br />\r\n- Simple gameplay (only walk up and down the sidewalk);<br />\r\n- Progressively increasing difficulty;<br />\r\n- Hi-Score autosaving;<br />\r\n- Score leaderboard.",
